Government and Public Involvement in Health Act</collab><year>2007</year><comment>Chapter 28 Schedules. Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.opsi.gov.uk/acts/acts2007/ukpga_20070028_en_25">http://www.opsi.gov.uk/acts/acts2007/ukpga_20070028_en_25</ext-link></comment></element-citation></ref><ref id="r29"><label>29</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><collab>Department of Health</collab><source>Commissioning framework for health and well-being</source><year>2007</year><publisher-loc>London</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Department of Health</publisher-name></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-group><table-wrap id="tb001" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Quality requirements (QRs)</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">NSF for LTNCs Quality requirements (QRs)</th><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Area of care</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">QR1</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">A person centred service</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">QR2</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Early recognition, prompt diagnosis and treatment</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">QR3</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Timely emergency and acute management from teams with appropriate skills and facilities</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">QR4</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Early and specialist rehabilitation</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">QR5</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Community rehabilitation and support</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">QR6</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Vocational rehabilitation</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">QR7</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Providing equipment and accommodation</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">QR8</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Providing personal care and support</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">QR9</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Palliative care</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">QR10</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Supporting family and carers</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">QR11</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Caring for people with neurological conditions in hospital or other health and social care settings</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-group></article>